# ledgerline

Ledger reconciliation service. Python 3.11, code in `src/ledgerline/`, tests in `tests/`.

## Commands

- `bin/check` runs lint and the unit tests.
- `bin/deploy staging|production` deploys the current commit.
- `bin/release <version>` tags the commit and publishes the package.

## Rules

- You must run `bin/check` before every commit.
- Never merge to main without a human approving the pull request (`gh pr merge`).
- Never deploy to production without a human go-ahead.
- A release needs a human go-ahead before `bin/release` runs.
